[SIZE=5]Please use this instead of the original AddOn[/SIZE]

Collects furnishings you want to craft in a shopping list and shows the required materials.

This is a patch for noobiandus' [URL="http://esoui.com/downloads/info1638-FurnitureShoppingList.html"]Furniture Shopping List[/URL], needed since the Furniture Catalogue 2.0 API change.
All credits for FurnitureShoppingList go to @noobiandus, who is unfortunately missing in action!

[COLOR=wheat][SIZE=6]Links[/SIZE][/COLOR][LIST]
[*][URL="https://github.com/wookiefriseur/FSL"]GitHub: source and issues[/URL]
[*][URL="https://wookiefriseur.github.io/LFC/"]Web interface for creating lists compatible with FSL 2.0 (not released yet)[/URL][/LIST]
[COLOR=wheat][SIZE=6]Depends on[/SIZE][/COLOR][LIST]
[*][URL="https://www.esoui.com/downloads/info4804-LibFurnitureCatalogue.html"]LibFurnitureCatalogue[/URL] (required)
[*][URL="https://www.esoui.com/downloads/info1146-LibCustomMenu.html"]LibCustomMenu[/URL] (required)
[*][URL="https://www.esoui.com/downloads/info1617-FurnitureCatalogue.html"]FurnitureCatalogue[/URL] (optional): add items from the catalogue, export lists to import here
[*]Master Merchant (optional): price estimate for the materials
[*]LibPrice (planned): will replace MM so prices can come from different sources[/LIST]

[COLOR=wheat][SIZE=6]How to use[/SIZE][/COLOR]

[COLOR=wheat][SIZE=3]Add furnishings[/SIZE][/COLOR][LIST]
[*]Item menus: right-click a craftable furnishing or blueprint -> [B]Add to shopping list[/B], then enter amount
[*]Crafting stations: select the recipe and press the [B]Add to Shopping List[/B] hotkey
[*][B]Import List[/B]: paste lines exported from FurnitureCatalogue or the web interface, or use plain item ids. Each craftable item is added once[/LIST]

[COLOR=wheat][SIZE=3]Main window[/SIZE][/COLOR][LIST]
[*][B]Subtract Owned[/B]: show only materials that you are missing. [B]Show Full Need[/B] switches back
[*][B]Print[/B]: opens the output window. It splits the materials into pages that fit a chat message or a mail, as item links or plain names
[*][B]Clear[/B]: empties the list
[*]Window is resizeable[/LIST]

[COLOR=wheat][SIZE=6]Chat commands and keys[/SIZE][/COLOR][LIST]
[*][B]/sl[/B] or [B]/fsl[/B] -> open or close the main window
[*]Controls -> FurnitureShoppingList: keys for [B]Toggle Shopping List window[/B] and [B]Add to Shopping List[/B][/LIST]
